<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1724926237"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.556"><div begin="54.508" end="1:31.178" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="54.508" end="1:01.536" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.508" end="55.562">房里</span><span begin="55.562" end="56.898">铺叠整</span><span begin="56.898" end="58.033">齐</span> <span begin="58.564" end="59.732">不太熟</span><span begin="59.732" end="1:01.536">悉</span></p><p begin="1:05.174" end="1:12.727" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.174" end="1:07.170">往事如短丝堆</span><span begin="1:07.170" end="1:08.013">集</span> <span begin="1:08.121" end="1:09.600">洒落窗前</span><span begin="1:09.600" end="1:10.837">光线</span><span begin="1:10.837" end="1:12.727">里</span></p><p begin="1:15.403" end="1:21.287" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.403" end="1:16.380">我</span><span begin="1:16.380" end="1:17.303">可以</span> <span begin="1:17.358" end="1:20.201">接受感情已瓦解成</span><span begin="1:20.201" end="1:21.287">雨</span></p><p begin="1:21.819" end="1:26.768" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.819" end="1:22.710">可以</span> <span begin="1:22.870" end="1:25.576">接受你断线会有意</span><span begin="1:25.576" end="1:26.768">义</span></p><p begin="1:27.289" end="1:31.178" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.289" end="1:28.198">可以</span> <span begin="1:28.289" end="1:29.696">却还没</span><span begin="1:29.696" end="1:31.178">勇气</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.446" end="1:56.930" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:34.446" end="1:40.248" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.446" end="1:35.476">有没有</span><span begin="1:35.476" end="1:36.829">足够</span><span begin="1:36.829" end="1:37.948">回忆能</span><span begin="1:37.948" end="1:38.510">编</span><span begin="1:38.510" end="1:39.590">织成棉</span><span begin="1:39.590" end="1:40.248">被</span></p><p begin="1:40.616" end="1:45.573" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.616" end="1:42.330">有如你</span><span begin="1:42.330" end="1:43.877">臂弯在温</span><span begin="1:43.938" end="1:44.976">暖我的</span><span begin="1:44.976" end="1:45.573">背</span></p><p begin="1:45.767" end="1:56.930" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.767" end="1:46.334">我只</span><span begin="1:46.334" end="1:48.187">剩下</span><span begin="1:48.469" end="1:52.891">拼凑不了你</span><span begin="1:52.891" end="1:54.575">的纤</span><span begin="1:54.575" end="1:56.930">维</span></p></div><div begin="1:59.977" end="2:36.658" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:59.977" end="2:07.112" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.977" end="2:01.644">答应你会复</span><span begin="2:01.644" end="2:03.054">习</span> <span begin="2:03.980" end="2:05.165">幸福程</span><span begin="2:05.165" end="2:07.112">序</span></p><p begin="2:10.929" end="2:18.854" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.929" end="2:12.583">包括你先离</span><span begin="2:12.583" end="2:13.527">席</span> <span begin="2:13.659" end="2:15.114">包括你我</span><span begin="2:15.114" end="2:16.423">道别</span><span begin="2:16.423" end="2:18.854">离</span></p><p begin="2:20.837" end="2:26.601" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.837" end="2:21.778">我</span><span begin="2:21.778" end="2:22.768">也许</span> <span begin="2:22.891" end="2:25.626">还想亚麻色衬衫的</span><span begin="2:25.626" end="2:26.601">你</span></p><p begin="2:27.267" end="2:32.009" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.267" end="2:28.207">也许</span> <span begin="2:28.316" end="2:31.100">还想我拥抱太过亲</span><span begin="2:31.100" end="2:32.009">密</span></p><p begin="2:32.725" end="2:36.658" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.725" end="2:33.712">也许</span> <span begin="2:33.759" end="2:34.482">太仔</span><span begin="2:34.482" end="2:35.290">细</span> <span begin="2:35.290" end="2:36.658">喔</span></p></div><div begin="2:37.257" end="2:58.752" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:37.257" end="2:43.059" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.257" end="2:38.287">有没有</span><span begin="2:38.287" end="2:39.640">足够</span><span begin="2:39.640" end="2:40.759">回忆能</span><span begin="2:40.759" end="2:41.321">编</span><span begin="2:41.321" end="2:42.401">织成棉</span><span begin="2:42.401" end="2:43.059">被</span></p><p begin="2:43.399" end="2:48.306" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.399" end="2:45.113">有如你</span><span begin="2:45.113" end="2:46.660">臂弯在温</span><span begin="2:46.721" end="2:47.759">暖我的</span><span begin="2:47.759" end="2:48.306">背</span></p><p begin="2:48.504" end="2:58.752" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.504" end="2:49.095">我只</span><span begin="2:49.095" end="2:50.924">剩下</span><span begin="2:51.206" end="2:55.628">拼凑不了你</span><span begin="2:55.628" end="2:57.312">的纤</span><span begin="2:57.312" end="2:58.752">维</span></p></div><div begin="3:00.000" end="3:22.731" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="3:00.000" end="3:05.325" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.000" end="3:00.928">当时我们</span><span begin="3:00.928" end="3:02.802">不懂挨近一点</span> <span begin="3:02.802" end="3:05.325">不一定交集成诺言</span></p><p begin="3:05.500" end="3:10.621" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.500" end="3:06.652">太用力结果</span><span begin="3:06.652" end="3:07.208">拧捻成</span><span begin="3:07.208" end="3:08.233">断裂点</span> <span begin="3:08.233" end="3:09.156">不再</span><span begin="3:09.156" end="3:10.621">相连</span></p><p begin="3:10.986" end="3:16.210" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.986" end="3:11.827">当时我们</span><span begin="3:11.827" end="3:13.735">不懂分开一点</span> <span begin="3:13.735" end="3:16.210">不一定徘徊在边缘</span></p><p begin="3:16.460" end="3:22.731" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.460" end="3:17.243">如今只能</span><span begin="3:17.243" end="3:19.255">从纸屑取得半点</span> <span begin="3:19.255" end="3:20.890">微弱关</span><span begin="3:20.890" end="3:22.731">联</span></p></div><div begin="3:25.670" end="3:58.120" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3:25.670" end="3:38.681" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.670" end="3:28.717">我们是</span><span begin="3:29.192" end="3:32.190">飘零在</span><span begin="3:32.630" end="3:35.279">风里的</span><span begin="3:35.881" end="3:38.681">纤维</span></p><p begin="3:39.963" end="3:58.120" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.963" end="3:42.187">只能</span><span begin="3:42.209" end="3:46.540">远远避开</span><span begin="3:46.869" end="3:50.157">彼此的</span><span begin="3:51.173" end="3:52.273">周</span><span begin="3:52.273" end="3:58.120">围</span></p></div></body></tt>